(7134511, 1093227, 117534, '<td valign="top">I hate to criticize a good portrait, but on my screen her facial skin looks very plastic, like over PP... She''s too young and pretty to need that. Other than that I think it''s a LOVELY shot, the red eye is awesome!</td>', 'I hate to criticize a good portrait, but on my screen her facial skin looks very plastic, like over PP... She''s too young and pretty to need that. Other than that I think it''s a LOVELY shot, the red eye is awesome!', '2013-11-25 00:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7134512, 1092844, 117534, '<td valign="top">This is Lovely, the PP and light, suggest the age, without the harshness of actually showing all the wrinkles .... This is how all my portraits (of me) should be handled!!</td>', 'This is Lovely, the PP and light, suggest the age, without the harshness of actually showing all the wrinkles .... This is how all my portraits (of me) should be handled!!', '2013-11-25 00:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
