(7134525, 1093271, 108069, '<td valign="top">For what it''s worth, I think there are three standout images in this challenge, and this is one of them. From what I can remember this is the best title, though. Great stuff. Top marks.</td>', 'For what it''s worth, I think there are three standout images in this challenge, and this is one of them. From what I can remember this is the best title, though. Great stuff. Top marks.', '2013-11-25 00:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
