(7134722, 1093159, 124815, '<td valign="top">An absolute portrait of a facet of a country also (unless I am wrong) but this man is French and he knows that "la jeunesse est une courte erreur, et la vieillesse un long regret" (Henry Duvernois) (the youth is a short error and old age a long regret)<br/> <br/>Amazing shot and a enthusiastic applause from me</td>', 'An absolute portrait of a facet of a country also (unless I am wrong) but this man is French and he knows that "la jeunesse est une courte erreur, et la vieillesse un long regret" (Henry Duvernois) (the youth is a short error and old age a long regret) Amazing shot and a enthusiastic applause from me', '2013-11-25 11:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7134723, 1093251, 124815, '<td valign="top">This man comes for the Dutch Old Masters paintings and just fools us with a more modern cap. Splendid portrait!</td>', 'This man comes for the Dutch Old Masters paintings and just fools us with a more modern cap. Splendid portrait!', '2013-11-25 11:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
