(7134861, 1093313, 43565, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting on the subject, but find the brightness of the window distracting. I think I would like it better cropped so that only two panes were showing, the rest doesn''t add anything, in my opinion.</td>', 'I like the lighting on the subject, but find the brightness of the window distracting. I think I would like it better cropped so that only two panes were showing, the rest doesn''t add anything, in my opinion.', '2013-11-25 17:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
